# Onyx pack — what does not belong in the repository

# Python leftovers
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Local state the pack writes while it runs. Committing it means every clone
# starts with someone else's cache and someone else's chain state.
_cache/
_backups/
*.log

# Your own prompt library: hundreds of prompts and their thumbnails, written
# as you work. It is personal, it changes on every save, and it would make the
# repository grow forever. Remove this line if you deliberately want to ship a
# starter library.
_prompt_library/

# Sample media — 1.3 GB of it. GitHub warns past 50 MB per file and a repo this
# size is slow to clone for everyone, forever, because git keeps every version.
# Distribute these separately (a release asset, a drive link) rather than in
# the history.
Resources/
example influencer images/
Example Faces/

# Release archives built locally
*.zip

# Etat par installation (id de machine, cache de session) — propre a chaque
# utilisateur, ne doit jamais etre commite ni partage entre installs.
nodes/.render_profile_id
nodes/.render_profile_cache.json

# Le code du Worker de licence ne doit JAMAIS partir dans le depot distribue :
# c'est celui que les utilisateurs du pack clonent. S'il contient le code
# serveur de verification, chaque utilisateur recoit la logique complete de
# ce qui est cense le bloquer. A versionner, si besoin, dans un depot separe
# et prive que toi seul utilises.
license-worker/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
